			"notes": "- Each worn piece shows as its own icon beside the hotbar, stacked head to foot, dye, trim and shimmer included.\n- Under each icon, its durability bar, green to red, flashing when it is nearly broken.\n- A piece that takes a hit shakes and flashes; one that breaks leaves its slot flashing red.\n- A shield in the offhand sits beside the boots with its own durability bar, in place of vanilla's offhand slot.\n- Above the hearts, in place of vanilla's chestplates: armor points, toughness, and a bar over your hearts showing how many a full-health hit would leave you.\n- Protection enchantments count toward it."
